        <h2>Hi</h2>
        <p>You can find my CV at; <a href="/cv">ste-pam.com/cv</a></p>
        <h3>Server Side</h3>
        <p>I work with <abbr title="Microsoft">MS</abbr> technologies, mainly C# (.NET 8-10) and SQL. I build APIs and Function based services over PaaS and container infrastructure, with a focus on distributed systems, microservices and event-driven patterns. I've also worked with Umbraco and MVC in the past.</p>
        <p>Clean, testable, maintainable code can be adopted by anyone if they follow:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>SOLID principles</li>
            <li>DDD and CQRS</li>
            <li>TDD and proper testing</li>
            <li>Onion/Clean architecture</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Azure</h3>
        <p>I'm a <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/en-us/ste-pammenter/DE05394C53DAB03D?sharingId=77956A493FCEC46F">certified Azure Developer Associate</a>. I work with Container Apps, Functions, Service Bus, SQL, CosmosDB, Redis and API Management, and I use Azure DevOps for pipelines and delivery.</p>
        <h3>Leading Teams</h3>
        <p>I've led engineering teams for several years, balancing technical planning and architectural decisions with working closely with product and the people in the team.</p>
        <h3>Front End</h3>
        <p>My roots are in HTML5, SASS/CSS and JavaScript. I've used Vue.js and TypeScript in recent years, though these days I'm firmly backend.</p>
